{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o011a","title":"曹休石亭战陆议败绩","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o011a-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"曹休石亭战陆议败绩","evidence":["mingdi-e-o011a-q"]},{"id":"luxun-e-o028a-account","label":"《陆逊传第十三》正文","text":"陆议与朱桓全琮三路破曹休追至夹石","evidence":["luxun-e-o028a-q"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o045d-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"曹休因吴将诈降而深入，交战不利退石亭，夜惊弃甲兵辎重。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o045d-q"]},{"id":"wgc-a-0-e13","label":"正文","text":"曹休征吴失利于夹石王凌力战决围","evidence":["wgc-q0154","wgc-q0003"]},{"id":"hequan-a-b6df40ea2ceeb646a38d","label":"正文","text":"权使琮与陆逊破曹休于石亭","evidence":["hequan-q-2afeb15e4179e2c6965f"]},{"id":"hequan-a-9b2e1baf57e7b3dd930b","label":"正文","text":"密计报施行曹休信鲂帅十万入皖","evidence":["hequan-q-ed9abb31471fb1300eba"]},{"id":"hequan-a-367d223522dd77d412e4","label":"正文","text":"鲂随陆逊横截曹休斩获万计","evidence":["hequan-q-9c04392ea2c13e9d3f34"]},{"id":"hequan-a-82fa595a4a3498ac9319","label":"正文","text":"七年〖4〗，权到皖。使琮与辅国将军陆逊击曹休，破之于石亭","evidence":["hequan-q-2afeb15e4179e2c6965f"]},{"id":"chengguo-a-5dff187d26b61174931c","label":"正文","text":"曹休败退吴欲塞夹石遇救得不没","evidence":["chengguo-q-669f81846adbd9bfb438"]},{"id":"liusima-a-ac0c8e32fe437d7eb767","label":"正文","text":"太和二年帝使贾逵督满宠、胡质等四军从西阳直向东关","evidence":["liusima-q-370dbbad6a87363b1da8"]},{"id":"liusima-a-29368d35c26659e185c5","label":"正文","text":"逵至五将山，休表贼请降求深入，诏宣王驻军，逵东与休合进","evidence":["liusima-q-61347dbba77a5b3a2780"]},{"id":"liusima-a-2069b08032606a2f54e4","label":"正文","text":"贾逵料贼必并军于皖、休必败，部署诸将水陆并进","evidence":["liusima-q-514a28cf96f2848649c5"]},{"id":"liusima-a-938ba17389cc269b0d6f","label":"正文","text":"行二百里得生贼，言休战败、权遣兵断夹石","evidence":["liusima-q-34ebc4333e41238cb1f8"]},{"id":"liusima-a-0d74ecb9f201501ecd44","label":"正文","text":"贾逵力主疾进出其不意，兼道进军多设旗鼓为疑兵","evidence":["liusima-q-94f46ae12716d005b862"]},{"id":"liusima-a-7c1cb08b91ca04d2d36a","label":"正文","text":"贼见逵军遂退，逵据夹石以兵粮给休，休军乃振","evidence":["liusima-q-60815b50b05409c75607"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-55f09df98670e4964a94","label":"正文","text":"黄武七年，鄱阳太守周鲂谲诱魏大司马曹休；休将步骑十万，至皖城以迎鲂","evidence":["zhulv-q-5bf1aafd1427750a4ac5"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-cf560cfdd95c063e3122","label":"正文","text":"时陆逊为元帅，全琮与桓为左、右督，各督三万人击休","evidence":["zhulv-q-7f64cfcd6eebc75196a2"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-315088dde157b902ea3c","label":"正文","text":"休知见欺，当引军还；自负众盛，（徼）〔邀〕于一战","evidence":["zhulv-q-577e1bad3da930cf0e7e"]},{"id":"shiyi-a-e2718f36c43e18223d7f","label":"正文","text":"曹休到，吴军大破之","evidence":["shiyi-q-88c9220ecaf50448e4df"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0039","role":"战败","evidence":["mingdi-e-o011a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0115","role":"击败","evidence":["mingdi-e-o011a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0028","role":"左翼","evidence":["luxun-e-o028a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0005","role":"右翼","evidence":["luxun-e-o028a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0004","role":"力战决围救曹休","evidence":["wgc-q0154","wgc-q0003"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"到皖、使琮与辅国将军陆逊击曹休","evidence":["hequan-q-2afeb15e4179e2c6965f"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0058","role":"合众随陆逊横截休","evidence":["hequan-q-9c04392ea2c13e9d3f34"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"使逵督前将军满宠、东莞太守胡质等四军，从西阳直向东关","evidence":["liusima-q-370dbbad6a87363b1da8"]},{"person":"identity-six-20261024-p-jia-kui-liangdao","role":"督满宠、胡质等四军，从西阳直向东关；至五将山，东行与休合进；度贼无东关之备，必并军于皖，休深入与贼战必败，乃部署诸将，水陆并进；行二百里，得生贼；称休兵败于外、路绝于内，安危之机不及终日；今疾进出其不意，先人以夺其心，贼见吾兵必走，若待后军贼已断险兵虽多何益；乃兼道进军，多设旗鼓为疑兵；据夹石，以兵粮给休，贼见逵军遂退，休军乃振","evidence":["liusima-q-370dbbad6a87363b1da8","liusima-q-61347dbba77a5b3a2780","liusima-q-514a28cf96f2848649c5","liusima-q-34ebc4333e41238cb1f8","liusima-q-94f46ae12716d005b862","liusima-q-60815b50b05409c75607"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0038","role":"前将军，受逵督","evidence":["liusima-q-370dbbad6a87363b1da8"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0047","role":"东莞太守，受逵督","evidence":["liusima-q-370dbbad6a87363b1da8"]},{"person":"wudi-p0364","role":"时为司马宣王，从江陵；受诏驻军","evidence":["liusima-q-370dbbad6a87363b1da8","liusima-q-61347dbba77a5b3a2780"]}],"place":{"text":"石亭","evidence":["mingdi-e-o011a-q"]},"time":{"year":228,"label":"太和二年秋九月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y228","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o008","basis":"太和二年秋九月"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o011a-q","mingdi-q-o008","mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o011a-q","source_order":[3,58,"O011a"],"related_events":[{"event":"wuzhu-e-o082a","type":"related","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o082a-q","mingdi-e-o011a-q"]}],"order":745},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o082a","title":"孙权至皖口陆逊破曹休于石亭吕范卒","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o082a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"孙权至皖口陆逊破曹休于石亭吕范卒","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o082a-q"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-0c3ed078b365883b7183","label":"正文","text":"黄武七年，范迁大司马；印绶未下，疾卒；权素服举哀，遣使者追赠印绶","evidence":["zhulv-q-683a8ab48c5a3b0ce599"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"进军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o082a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0115","role":"督战","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o082a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0039","role":"战败","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o082a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0157","role":"卒","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o082a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":228,"label":"秋八月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y228","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o080","basis":"秋八月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o082a-q","wuzhu-q-o080","zhuge-q-o032","zhuge-q-b-0d2dada465388f4c2e39"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o082a-q","source_order":[47,398,"O082a"],"related_events":[{"event":"mingdi-e-o011a","type":"related","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o082a-q","mingdi-e-o011a-q"]}],"order":8281}],"persons":[{"id":"identity-six-20261024-p-jia-kui-liangdao","name":"贾逵（字梁道）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0038","name":"满宠","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0047","name":"胡质","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0004","name":"王凌","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0005","name":"全琮","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0039","name":"曹休","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0364","name":"司马懿","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0028","name":"朱桓","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0058","name":"周鲂","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0115","name":"陆逊","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-669f81846adbd9bfb438","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-95aff85da71c9c1e1384","layer":"original","quote":"会休军已败，尽弃器仗辎重，退还。吴欲塞夹石〖3〗，遇救兵至，是以官军得不没","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":404,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":106,"end":143,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-2afeb15e4179e2c6965f","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-eb3cad55b9f9c0780fa1","layer":"original","quote":"七年〖4〗，权到皖。使琮与辅国将军陆逊击曹休，破之于石亭","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-9c04392ea2c13e9d3f34","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-20e5d84c088b067e210c","layer":"original","quote":"鲂亦合众，随陆逊横截休；休幅裂瓦解，斩获万计","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":349,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-ed9abb31471fb1300eba","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-20e5d84c088b067e210c","layer":"original","quote":"被报施行。休果信鲂，帅步骑十万，辎重满道，径来入皖","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":349,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-34ebc4333e41238cb1f8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-ab043c3c626c0afdec2c","layer":"original","quote":"行二百里，得生贼〖3〗，言“休战败，权遣兵断夹石”。诸将不知所出，或欲待后军","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-370dbbad6a87363b1da8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-0985d8c8acf24f9c721e","layer":"original","quote":"太和二年，帝使逵督前将军满宠、东莞太守胡质等四军，从西阳直向东关〖2〗；曹休从皖；司马宣王从江陵","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-514a28cf96f2848649c5","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-ab043c3c626c0afdec2c","layer":"original","quote":"逵度贼无东关之备，必并军于皖；休深入与贼战，必败。乃部署诸将，水陆并进","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-60815b50b05409c75607","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-ab043c3c626c0afdec2c","layer":"original","quote":"贼见逵军，遂退。逵据夹石，以兵粮给休，休军乃振","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":180,"end":203,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-61347dbba77a5b3a2780","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-0985d8c8acf24f9c721e","layer":"original","quote":"逵至五将山，休更表贼有请降者，求深入应之。诏宣王驻军；逵东，与休合进","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":61,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-94f46ae12716d005b862","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-ab043c3c626c0afdec2c","layer":"original","quote":"逵曰：“休兵败于外，路绝于内；进不能战，退不得还：安危之机，不及终日！贼以军无后继，故至此。今疾进，出其不意，此所谓先人以夺其心也，贼见吾兵必走。若待后军，贼已断险，兵虽多，何益！”乃兼道进军，多设旗鼓为疑兵","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":75,"end":179,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-e-o028a-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-25441637d6731269f663","layer":"original","quote":"逊自为中部，令朱桓、全琮为左、右翼，三道俱进。果冲休伏兵，因驱走之；追亡逐北〖4〗，径至夹石。斩获万余，牛马骡驴车乘万两，军资器械略尽。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":136,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o011a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-0f7011a011e59527fd63","layer":"original","quote":"秋九月，曹休率诸军至皖〖16〗，与吴将陆议战于石亭〖17〗，败绩〖18〗。乙酉〖19〗，立皇子穆为繁阳王。庚子〖20〗，大司马曹休薨。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-88c9220ecaf50448e4df","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-575fa66bbceefbf95dd0","layer":"original","quote":"休到，大破之","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":6,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0003","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-6b32530f1b0a1d7ab598","layer":"original","quote":"转在青州。是时海滨乘丧乱之后，法度未整。凌布政施教，赏善罚恶，甚有纲纪〖6〗；百姓称之，不容于口〖7〗。后从曹休征吴，与贼遇于夹石。休军失利，凌力战决围，休得免难。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0154","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-6b32530f1b0a1d7ab598","layer":"original","quote":"后从曹休征吴，与贼遇于夹石。休军失利，凌力战决围，休得免难","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":52,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o082a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-c344c51caf4dab973911","layer":"original","quote":"秋八月，权至皖口；使将军陆逊，督诸将大破休于石亭〖36〗。大司马吕范卒〖37〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":397,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o045d-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-772f3a3de27ca1a3e015","layer":"original","quote":"贼将伪降〖12〗，休深入；战不利，退还宿石亭。军夜惊，士卒乱，弃甲兵辎重甚多。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-577e1bad3da930cf0e7e","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-f6c93f523095dbe1d1e8","layer":"original","quote":"休知见欺，当引军还；自负众盛，（徼）〔邀〕于一战","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":62,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-5bf1aafd1427750a4ac5","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-f6c93f523095dbe1d1e8","layer":"original","quote":"黄武七年，鄱阳太守周鲂谲诱魏大司马曹休〖1〗；休将步骑十万，至皖城以迎鲂","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-7f64cfcd6eebc75196a2","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-f6c93f523095dbe1d1e8","layer":"original","quote":"时陆逊为元帅；全琮与桓为左、右督，各督三万人击休","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":37,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
